---
// Notice at the top of every prototype page (FR-007). A plain paragraph, not a
// landmark. Palette tokens only; passes AA in both themes.
---

<p
  data-prototype-notice
  class="not-prose mb-6 rounded-lg border border-lavender-700 bg-lavender-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-dusk-900 dark:border-lavender-300 dark:bg-dusk-900 dark:text-white"
>
  <strong>Design prototype for review.</strong> Not part of the live site.
  <a
    href="/design/portfolio/"
    class="ml-1 inline-block min-h-6 underline underline-offset-2 text-dusk-900 dark:text-white"
    >All portfolio directions</a
  >
</p>
